# Next config + content config

- **`next.config.ts`:** Framework config (currently empty). Change it only for real needs such as remote image domains or redirects.
- **`src/lib/site.ts`:** `SITE_URL` drives absolute URLs (`metadataBase`, sitemap, RSS).
- **`src/lib/content.ts`:** Defines the zod schemas and loaders for all collections; changing a schema requires updating markdown files and every importer under `src/app`, `src/layouts` and `src/components` that uses `entry.data`.
- Edit these files together only when the linking is real. Avoid unrelated edits when touching one file.
